%% title: Reuse a render from the registry
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as estate-kit service
    participant O as ghcr
    participant R as Rust binary
    S->>S: render key from the input digests
    S->>O: a render with this key?
    alt found
        O-->>S: reuse it
    else not found
        O-->>S: no such render
        S->>R: render this Project
    end
